NAME

ulibGetFileLength - Returns the length of a file


SYNOPSIS

long ulibGetFileLength(UBYTE *FileToOpen)
                              a0


RETURNS

This function returns the length of an AmigaDOS file, or zero (0) if the file
could not be opened.

NOTE:  If another program has an exclusive lock on <FileToOpen>, zero (0) will
       be returned, since information will be unavailable on the file.
